              "string": "Create one continuous 15-second vertical phone-shot UGC testimonial. Image 1 controls the exact creator identity, face, room, wardrobe, lighting, and natural skin texture. Image 2 controls only the product silhouette, muted-olive finish, charcoal lid, and proportions. Do not transfer the product image background. Product: {{ product }}. [0.0-4.5s] Tight chest-up framing of the creator alone. No product or hands visible. She begins the exact dialogue below with mild surprise. [4.5-7.0s] Without cutting away from her face, she briefly lifts the Image 2 product from below frame into one lower corner, never blocking her face, then lowers it completely out of frame at 7.0s. [7.0-15.0s] Keep the camera on her face with the product and hands fully out of frame through the final smile. Exact dialogue: {{ script }} No extra words. Generate picture, voice, and lip-sync together in one pass. Natural adult female voice, clear conversational English, warm mid-register, relaxed creator cadence, subtle room tone. No music, voice-over, extra speakers, subtitles, on-screen text, logos, jump cuts, cutaway product shots, product before 4.5s, product after 7.0s, product morphing, beauty-filter skin, or compositing seams."
